1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,288
This is my grandma
这是我奶奶

2
00:00:01,530 --> 00:00:03,609
my grandma is very beautiful
我奶奶很漂亮

3
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,649
She makes delicious food for me
她给我做好吃的

4
00:00:05,889 --> 00:00:07,809
We like to bake cookies together
我们喜欢一起烤饼干

5
00:00:08,169 --> 00:00:11,448
Grandma tells me stories and teaches me how to garden
奶奶给我讲故事教我园艺

6
00:00:11,689 --> 00:00:14,208
We plant flowers and vegetables in the yard
我们在院子里种花种菜

7
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,728
She is very patient and combs my hair
她很有耐心给我梳头

8
00:00:16,929 --> 00:00:18,882
I Love my grandma very much
我很爱我的奶奶

